WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two different tones can make your hearing system perceive
a beat that neither channel contains. That's fascinating.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But it doesn't mean your brain has entered a promised state.
Researchers reviewing fourteen EEG experiments found conflicting results.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
And evidence from general audio trials doesn't establish
what any one branded recording can do.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
So before you buy a meditation soundtrack, separate what's
in the package from the outcome someone says it guarantees.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
You can begin with a free twelve-minute routine.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then decide whether a structured audio library
is worth considering.
